## About the standard

Open standard for verifiable mobile application security requirements.

The control and requirement statements below are reproduced in English from the publisher’s open data.

Official source: [OWASP MASVS 2.1.0](https://github.com/OWASP/masvs/releases/tag/v2.1.0).

